Definitions in `webster` come from Webster's 1828 American Dictionary of
the English Language (public domain), transcribed by akaitsurugi and
published under CC BY-SA 4.0:
https://github.com/akaitsurugi/webster1828

`webster` is a reduced, plain-text subset of that transcription: only the
words the KJV itself uses, resolved by tools/build_webster.py. The subset
stays under CC BY-SA 4.0.
